第1句 背景:Last Friday, on my way home, I saw something I will never forget.
第2句 起因:An old man tripped over a stone and fell, dropping his bags.
第3-5句 经过:Seeing the old man fall, a girl ran over. Kneeling beside him, she helped him up. Then she walked him to a bench, smiling warmly.
第6-7句 感动与美德:What moved me most was her quiet kindness. Her small act showed true virtue.', 2, 'required3', 'U2');

